text:
Paint a sunset over green hills in this p5 sketch:
```javascript
function setup() {
  createCanvas(400, 400, WEBGL);
  brush.scaleBrushes(2);
  noLoop();
}

function draw() {
  translate(-width / 2, -height / 2);
  background("#f4efe4");
  // painting goes here
  fill(#87ceeb, 0.7)
  noFill()
  fill(#27b5b1, 1)
  beginShape()
  vertex(50, 350)
  vertex(100, 375)
  vertex(150, 375)
  vertex(200, 350)
  endShape(true)
}
```

